---
const postUrl = 'https://www.instagram.com/p/Da1IkzuPgWx/';
const embedUrl = postUrl.endsWith('/') ? `${postUrl}embed` : `${postUrl}/embed`;
---

<section class="sec instagram-section" aria-labelledby="instagram-title">
  <div class="wrap instagram-layout">
    <div class="instagram-copy reveal" data-gsap="section-head">
      <p class="section-index">05 / DETRÁS DEL PLANO</p>
      <h2 class="sec-title" id="instagram-title">El taller,<br /><span>en vivo.</span></h2>
      <p>Ideas, materiales y espacios en proceso. Conoce el día a día de Mobi antes de que el plano llegue a tu casa.</p>
      <a class="sello instagram-cta" href="https://instagram.com/mobi_arquitectura" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Seguir en Instagram <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
    </div>
    <div class="phone-wrap reveal" data-gsap="phone">
      <span class="phone-note phone-note--top">VISTA EN OBRA · IG-01</span>
      <div class="phone" aria-label="Vista previa del perfil de Instagram de Mobi Arquitectura">
        <div class="phone-speaker"></div>
        <div class="phone-screen">
          <iframe
            src={embedUrl}
            class="insta-iframe"
            title="Publicación de Instagram de Mobi Arquitectura"
            loading="lazy"
            frameborder="0"
            scrolling="no"
            allowtransparency="true"
            referrerpolicy="strict-origin-when-cross-origin"
          ></iframe>
        </div>
      </div>
      <span class="phone-note phone-note--bottom">@MOBI_ARQUITECTURA</span>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
